  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Ice Bolt\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ice-bolt.png\" title=\"Image:Ice-bolt.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Ice-bolt.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ice-bolt.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Mage\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">?\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Deals Ice damage, slow movement + attack speed\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Ice Bolt</b> is a skill that Deals Ice damage.  There is also a chance that it will slow the target's Movement Speed by 40% and Attack speed by 20% for 5 seconds.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Deals Ice damage by X amount.</b> <br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 5\n</td><td> 10\n</td><td> 15\n</td><td> 20\n</td><td> 25\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 35\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 50\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 36-84\n</td><td> 68-158\n</td><td> 99-231\n</td><td> 131-305\n</td><td> 163-378\n</td><td> 194-452\n</td><td> 226-525\n</td><td> 257-599\n</td><td> 289-672\n</td><td> 321-746\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 64.3\n</td><td> 88.6\n</td><td> 112.9\n</td><td> 137.2\n</td><td> 161.5\n</td><td> 185.8\n</td><td> 210.1\n</td><td> 234.4\n</td><td> 258.7\n</td><td> 283.0\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 5568\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> 22272\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">15\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">16\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">17\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">18\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">19\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 65\n</td><td> 70\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 80\n</td><td> 85\n</td><td> 90\n</td><td> 95\n</td><td> 100\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td sty